|> Exercise
    work=ing
    handle=_more_closely_related_to_sin2x_or_

    Based on the graphs of Exercise >>_four_graphs_,
    or some other logic,
    does it seem more likely that $\cos^2 x$, $\sin^2 x$
    and $\cos x\sin x$ are more closely related to
    $$
    \sin(x/2)
    $$
    and/or $\cos(x/2)$,
    or to
    $$
    \sin(2x)
    $$
    and/or $\cos(2x)$?

    |> Solution

        Dance dance.